# Cancellation & Refund Policy
**Last update MAY 06, 2026**

This Cancellation and Refund Policy (the “Policy”) is made by viec carry india Private Limited, a private limited company incorporated under the Companies Act, 2013, (hereinafter referred to as “Needin” or the “Company”, which expression shall, unless the context otherwise requires, be deemed to mean and include its successor and permitted assigns).

